 ___[ Navigating Directories ]________________________________________|
|                                                                     |
|  cd                 --- Shows current working directory             |
|  cd <folder>        --- Changes to specified folder                 |
|  cd ..              --- Moves up to parent folder                   |
|  cd \               --- Moves to root directory                     |
|  cd /d D:\<folder>  --- Switches active drive and enters folder     |
|  dir                --- Lists files and details in directory        |
|  tree               --- Displays graphical directory tree structure |
|  cls                --- Clears the terminal screen                  |
|_____________________________________________________________________|
